["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"74. 从蒸汽机到无人驾驶4｜Waymo和它的对手们：我暗中考察了四个月 DARPA Grand Challenge AlexNet 端到端 Moon Shot Project Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-11-zhangxiaojun-waymo-领先不是技术最强-是没犯过大错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8_F5-pZxW0qc3AIA1z-jhMPrhA.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>Waymo 领先不是技术最强，是没犯过大错</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 起步最早、换过四任负责人、被业内一致看衰，最后却成了 L4 唯一还在引领行业的公司——因为它活了下来，且没犯 Cruise 和 Uber 那种致命错误。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">Waymo</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"73. AGI范式大转移：和广密预言草莓、OpenAI o1和self-play RL｜全球大模型季报4 Self-Play RL Scaling Law reward model RLHF MOE DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-05-zhangxiaojun-不做强化学习的公司-下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjRul75Gm9ZxrQhlHRKC87dFMPZK.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>不做强化学习的公司，下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言预训练遇到瓶颈后，硅谷最核心的几百名研究者已把资源压注到 self-play RL 上，它用推理算力换训练算力，让模型自己探索出逻辑推理能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">强化学习</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"71. 和楼天城聊聊Robotaxi和ACRush：“L2做得越厉害，离L4越远” contest based metric system MP