MidIIAWxxHD7f5q.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>中东不是风口，是正在上升的长期力量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中东的宏大叙事不是中国式全民创业的狂热，而是各国人奔着共同机会聚在一起；中国公司靠高效、灵活和定制化切入，但性价比不是首选，符合国家战略才是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东出海</span><span class=\"tag\">全球化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"52.【职场人性】论嫉妒：人类最禁忌的情感，在职场里暗涌 up or out 四元框架 Workplace Envy break winner\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-15-zhangxiaojun-嫉妒无法被消除-只会换个地方重新长出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsPJHRLiLKppm_iQKucW_AgEjHWP.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1215</span></div>\n<h2>嫉妒无法被消除，只会换个地方重新长出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你消掉一个引起嫉妒的偏差，人立刻会发明另一个——因为嫉妒的底层是分层，而分层是动物性的、消不掉的。好组织不是消灭嫉妒，是把拉别人下来的能量改成把自己拉上去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">职场人性</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"51. 地缘政治与大国汽车：中国跃居第一出口国？别浪费大危机 CKD/SKD TPS CVCC 年余效应\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-11-zhangxiaojun-中国汽车出口第一-但日本车企的出海课还没上完/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuNXQDWicOw4VPSxWLImj2a7GlH_.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1211</span></div>\n<h2>中国汽车出口第一，但日本车企的出海课还没上完</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国2023年出口441万辆跃居全球第一，但2012到2020年八年出口总量一直卡在每年100万台。日本车企50年代第一次出海美国惨败，靠70年代石油危机才翻身——危机是机会，但政治风险和经济风险同等重要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车出海</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"50. 95后、00后创业者怎么样了？他们的生猛、高马斯克值与现实 SIGGRAPH mesh PMF MVP Citation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-07-zhangxiaojun-95后创业者把马斯克值拉满-但偶像其实是毛主席/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvGH8uPrSj7x2SzPaKIZXrfyKohC.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1207</span></div>\n<h2>95后创业者把马斯克值拉满，但偶像其实是毛主席</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这波年轻创业者的驱动力不是钱，而是「这东西牛逼就先做」；他们不写BP、不刷榜、不主动做PR，只在意的圈子里积累reputation。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span><span class=\"tag\">AIGC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"48. OpenAI的权力游戏：脸谱、硅谷精英政治与讽刺意味 alignment nerdy AB 票机制 OpenAI LP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-21-zhangxiaojun-openai-政变-非营利董事会为何能踢走-ceo/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsMqlOKYMDR8cSp9rA89qtcRAbTC.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 政变：非营利董事会为何能踢走 CEO</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个 700 人、成立不到 5 年的公司，6 人非营利董事会行使一次权力就干成了政变——而它最大的股东微软连董事会成员都不是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"44. 谈诺贝尔经济奖与40+消失在黄金阶梯上的女人 greedy jobs quiet revolution marriage bar statistical discrimination\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-28-zhangxiaojun-女性职场起步领先-生育惩罚却把优势磨光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvytLxa9AF85a65Xh4b4KfK6zegX.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">53:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>女性职场起步领先，生育惩罚却把优势磨光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刚毕业时男女就业参与率几乎一样，过十年女性就落下来了，再过十几年又部分回去——这条曲线与生育时间高度吻合。被磨掉的不是能力，是连续的积累。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性别经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">生育惩罚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"42.【汽车史话02】集权者福特与全球第二畅销T型车的衰落 vertical integration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-18-zhangxiaojun-t型车曾占全球市场一半-却因19年不换代被通用取代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fok7EeXlkZbGUo_I_4yjUSRj_fId.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">50:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>T型车曾占全球市场一半，却因19年不换代被通用取代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福特靠一款车让普通人买得起汽车，T型车一度占据全球汽车销量的一半以上；但正因为它只有一个品种、一个颜色、十九年不换代，消费者没有换车的理由，市场被通用拿走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车史</span><span class=\"tag\">福特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"41.【汽车史话01】世界上第一辆燃油车、女车手和慈禧太后 Red Flag Act Otto cycle Whiz Kids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-15-zhangxiaojun-汽车只是马车上加个发动机-马车公司却一家没活下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhyzEVB3fH4klo9wdF0MApq4AanO.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">51:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>汽车只是马车上加个发动机，马车公司却一家没活下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">汽车不是马车上加一台发动机那么简单：动力总成换了，整个技术栈和市场跟着换，当年造车厢的马车公司没有一家活过百年。今天衡量电动车企，看的是它能不能掌控上游的电池。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车史</span><span class=\"tag\">内燃机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"29. 逆全球化思潮来势汹汹，外企CEO何故密集访华？ CDR 红筹架构 FDI 国际版\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-12-zhangxiaojun-外企ceo密集访华-逆全球化是政治问题-不是经济问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFcghZx7pOjDfhfU5E5McOkP2vv.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">50:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>外企CEO密集访华：逆全球化是政治问题，不是经济问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">逆全球化来势汹汹却挡不住CEO们排队来华，因为脱钩违反经济规律；但真正推动脱钩的不是经济逻辑，而是老大防老二的政治逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">外资</span>\n</div></div></a>"]